MODULE: ReadyScalarBatchOrder
TARGET: SnapshotExact
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: Scalar batch ordering publishes one crossed-clock batch instead of the per-key closure
PERTURBS: Publish

--- FIND
    /\ value' = [value EXCEPT ![c] = Fold(Complete(c) \cup done[c])]
--- REPLACE
    /\ value' = [value EXCEPT ![c] = [k \in Keys |-> IF k \in TxKeys(1) THEN Stamp(1,k) ELSE 0]]
--- END
